Wisecracking mercenary Deadpool battles the evil and powerful
Cable and other bad guys to save a boy's life.

4
00:17:46,666 --> 00:17:52,666
Wade Wilson / Deadpool / Juggernaut (voice), played by Ryan Reynolds.

5
